From: Codex <codex@openai.com>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 06:33:30 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] fix(macos): report unconfirmed saving after import render
 failure

Preserve imported calendar, Notes and contact copies, distinguish save NACK from post-append rendering failure, and cover retry/reopen without duplicates in the actual projected UI. Refs #778.
---
